<title>UK: Norfolk council reviews MGAM contract.</title>
<headline>Norfolk council reviews MGAM contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Norfolk County Council said on Monday it was keeping Morgan Grenfell Asset Management's (MGAM) contract to manage its pension fund under review in the wake of the sacking of a top fund manager last week.</p>
<p>&quot;Norfolk County Council is naturally concerned about recent events at Morgan Grenfell and is keeping a close watch upon developments,&quot; it said in a statement released in London.</p>
</text>
